WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.111
Watch and read: For your intonation practice, you ask “Where is my pen?”. What is the

00:00:05.111 --> 00:00:05.725
best answer?

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:11.627
The answer is: Use a questioning voice. Read the instruction carefully and choose the

00:00:11.627 --> 00:00:13.083
helpful or correct response.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:18.530
Watch and read: For your commands practice, sit down in class. What is the best

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:18.835
answer?

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:24.721
The answer is: Sit down.. Read the instruction carefully and choose the helpful or

00:00:24.721 --> 00:00:25.439
correct response.
